                  {
                    "value": "CAPACITY & SCENARIOS\nUtilization = allocated hours / available hours.\nGap = sum positive record demand-minus-capacity gaps.\nCoverage = record-capped supply / total service demand.\nDemand changes; capacity stays fixed. No gap netting.\nUnused equipment and workforce hours are separate.\n\nEVIDENCE LIMITS\n2024: 2,004; 2025: 2,000; 2026: 996 observations.\nPer-record measures control size, not changing mix.\nOne resource category per business unit; no duplicate filter.\nZero denominators return blank (not applicable).\nSynthetic results do not establish real-world causation.",
